  "transcript_source": "captions",
  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 0.0,
      "e": 1.57,
      "text": "Artemis II is safely home,"
    },
    {
      "s": 1.57,
      "e": 2.47,
      "text": "and the next chapter"
    },
    {
      "s": 2.47,
      "e": 3.57,
      "text": "is already underway."
    },
    {
      "s": 3.83,
      "e": 4.93,
      "text": "Here\u00e2\u0080\u0099s what you need to know,"
    },
    {
      "s": 4.93,
      "e": 6.13,
      "text": "in your NASA Minute."
    },
    {
      "s": 7.3,
      "e": 9.0,
      "text": "Last week, NASA\u00e2\u0080\u0099s Artemis II"
    },
    {
      "s": 9.0,
      "e": 10.23,
      "text": "mission came  to an end,"
    },
    {
      "s": 10.23,
      "e": 11.93,
      "text": "as the Orion  spacecraft"
    },
    {
      "s": 11.93,
      "e": 13.33,
      "text": "re-entered Earth\u00e2\u0080\u0099s atmosphere"
    },
    {
      "s": 13.33,
      "e": 14.17,
      "text": "and splashed down"
    },
    {
      "s": 14.17,
      "e": 16.07,
      "text": "safely off the coast of San Diego."
    },
    {
      "s": 16.67,
      "e": 18.0,
      "text": "The crew were all smiles"
    },
    {
      "s": 18.0,
      "e": 19.57,
      "text": "as they boarded the recovery vessel,"
    },
    {
      "s": 19.57,
      "e": 21.23,
      "text": "The USS John P. Murtha,"
    },
    {
      "s": 21.23,
      "e": 22.6,
      "text": "and began their journey home."
    },
    {
      "s": 23.87,
      "e": 24.67,
      "text": "The next day,"
    },
    {
      "s": 24.67,
      "e": 26.67,
      "text": "Reid, Victor, Christina, and Jeremy"
    },
    {
      "s": 26.67,
      "e": 28.4,
      "text": "were warmly welcomed home to Houston"
    },
    {
      "s": 28.4,
      "e": 30.47,
      "text": "by their families, fellow astronauts,"
    },
    {
      "s": 30.47,
      "e": 32.47,
      "text": "and other members of the NASA family."
    },
    {
      "s": 32.47,
      "e": 34.03,
      "text": "It\u00e2\u0080\u0099s a special thing  to be a human,"
    },
    {
      "s": 34.03,
      "e": 35.63,
      "text": "It\u00e2\u0080\u0099s a special thing  to be on planet Earth."
    },
    {
      "s": 35.63,
      "e": 37.5,
      "text": "Planet Earth,"
    },
    {
      "s": 37.5,
      "e": 40.33,
      "text": "you are a crew."
    },
    {
      "s": 40.33,
      "e": 43.77,
      "text": "Thank you. [Applause]"
    },
    {
      "s": 43.77,
      "e": 45.33,
      "text": "Stay tuned, because we\u00e2\u0080\u0099re already"
    },
    {
      "s": 45.33,
      "e": 46.8,
      "text": "ramping up for Artemis III."
    },
    {
      "s": 46.8,
      "e": 49.13,
      "text": "On Thursday at Kennedy Space Center,"
    },
    {
      "s": 49.13,
      "e": 50.53,
      "text": "the mobile launcher platform"
    },
    {
      "s": 50.53,
      "e": 51.3,
      "text": "was rolled back"
    },
    {
      "s": 51.3,
      "e": 52.7,
      "text": "into the Vehicle Assembly Building"
    },
    {
      "s": 52.7,
      "e": 54.73,
      "text": "to prepare it for its next mission."
    },
    {
      "s": 54.73,
      "e": 56.3,
      "text": "NASA is back in the business"
    },
    {
      "s": 56.3,
      "e": 57.83,
      "text": "of launching missions to the Moon!"
    },
    {
      "s": 59.2,
      "e": 61.9,
      "text": "NASA\u00e2\u0080\u0099s X-59 quiet  supersonic jet"
    },
    {
      "s": 61.9,
      "e": 64.23,
      "text": "is ramping up flight testing."
    },
    {
      "s": 64.23,
      "e": 65.37,
      "text": "Over the past few weeks,"
    },
    {
      "s": 65.37,
      "e": 67.53,
      "text": "teams at Armstrong Flight Research Center"
    },
    {
      "s": 67.53,
      "e": 69.3,
      "text": "have completed nine test flights,"
    },
    {
      "s": 69.3,
      "e": 71.4,
      "text": "with the aircraft now flying wheels-up"
    },
    {
      "s": 71.4,
      "e": 73.1,
      "text": "and pushing higher and faster \u00e2\u0080\u0094"
    },
    {
      "s": 73.1,
      "e": 74.5,
      "text": "approaching the speed of sound."
    },
    {
      "s": 76.5,
      "e": 77.8,
      "text": "Following a successful launch"
    },
    {
      "s": 77.8,
      "e": 78.67,
      "text": "over the weekend,"
    },
    {
      "s": 78.67,
      "e": 80.27,
      "text": "a Cygnus XL spacecraft"
    },
    {
      "s": 80.27,
      "e": 81.47,
      "text": "was successfully installed"
    },
    {
      "s": 81.47,
      "e": 84.73,
      "text": "to the International Space Station on Monday."
    },
    {
      "s": 84.73,
      "e": 87.77,
      "text": "NASA Astronauts Chris Williams and Jack Hathaway"
    },
    {
      "s": 87.77,
      "e": 90.43,
      "text": "used the station\u00e2\u0080\u0099s Canadarm2 robotic arm"
    },
    {
      "s": 90.43,
      "e": 91.77,
      "text": "to grab the spacecraft"
    },
    {
      "s": 91.77,
      "e": 93.3,
      "text": "and install it on the station,"
    },
    {
      "s": 93.3,
      "e": 95.67,
      "text": "bringing over 11,000 pounds of supplies"
    },
    {
      "s": 95.67,
      "e": 96.73,
      "text": "and science experiments"
    },
    {
      "s": 96.73,
      "e": 98.9,
      "text": "to the orbital laboratory."
    },
    {
      "s": 100.0,
      "e": 102.27,
      "text": "And finally, NASA\u00e2\u0080\u0099s SPHEREx mission"
    },
    {
      "s": 102.27,
      "e": 104.0,
      "text": "is uncovering the origins of water"
    },
    {
      "s": 104.0,
      "e": 104.87,
      "text": "in the universe,"
    },
    {
      "s": 104.87,
      "e": 106.6,
      "text": "mapping interstellar ice across"
    },
    {
      "s": 106.6,
      "e": 108.53,
      "text": "star-forming regions in our galaxy"
    },
    {
      "s": 108.53,
      "e": 111.63,
      "text": "spanning more than 600 light-years."
    },
    {
      "s": 111.63,
      "e": 113.53,
      "text": "These icy clouds are believed to be"
    },
    {
      "s": 113.53,
      "e": 115.4,
      "text": "the source of water found on planets,"
    },
    {
      "s": 115.4,
      "e": 118.4,
      "text": "comets \u00e2\u0080\u0094 and Earth itself."
    },
    {
      "s": 118.4,
      "e": 120.03,
      "text": "The world should get used to the Golden Age"
    },
    {
      "s": 120.03,
      "e": 121.8,
      "text": "of Space Exploration, because we\u00e2\u0080\u0099re"
    },
    {
      "s": 121.8,
      "e": 123.87,
      "text": "not stopping anytime soon."
    },
    {
      "s": 123.87,
      "e": 124.6,
      "text": "Thanks for watching,"
    },
    {
      "s": 124.6,
      "e": 125.4,
      "text": "we\u00e2\u0080\u0099ll see you next week."
    }
  ],
